OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh government takes control of
OL,4,Acontroversial Cardiff data centre plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FControversial plans to build a data
OL,7,Fcentre in Cardiff will be decided by
OL,8,Fthe Welsh government rather than the
OL,9,Fcity's council.
OL,11,FDeveloper Curtis Hall wants to build
OL,12,Fthe 30,292 square-metre facility on the
OL,13,Fsite of a park and ride near Llanrumney
OL,14,Fin the capital's eastern suburbs, and
OL,15,Fis seeking permission for gas turbines
OL,16,Fthat could temporarily power the site.
OL,18,FOfficials said "substantial
OL,19,Fcontroversy" meant it should be
OL,20,Fdetermined by the Welsh government.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
