OL,3,GNEWSAWelsh government takes control of
OL,4,Acontroversial Cardiff data centre plan
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe decision was made by Welsh Planning
OL,7,FMinister Sian Gwenllian the evening
OL,8,Fbefore a meeting where councillors had
OL,9,Fbeen due to discuss the scheme.
